        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    net_income = 2_500_000\n    basic_shares = 300_000\n    options_warrants = 30_000\n    exercise_price = 20\n    market_price = 30\n    \n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    proceeds = options_warrants * exercise_price\n    repurchased_shares = proceeds / market_price\n    additional_shares = options_warrants - repurchased_shares\n    diluted_shares = basic_shares + additional_shares\n    diluted_eps = net_income / diluted_shares\n    \n    # Return the answer rounded to the nearest cent\n    return round(diluted_eps, 2)\n```",
